msgid "Quality goes from 50 to 100. It was left at 88."
msgstr "La calidad va de 50 a 100. Se dejó en 88."

msgid "The longest side goes from 800 to 4000 px. It was left at 1600."
msgstr "El lado mayor va de 800 a 4000 px. Se dejó en 1600."

msgid "The WooCommerce cost field was turned on (Settings > Advanced > Features), which is where each product's cost is stored."
msgstr "Se encendió el campo de costo de WooCommerce (Ajustes > Avanzado > Funciones), que es donde se guarda el costo de cada producto."

msgid "Google Fonts does not know the font \"%s\". Copy the name exactly as it appears on fonts.google.com. The previous one was kept."
msgstr "Google Fonts no conoce la fuente \"%s\". Copia el nombre tal como aparece en fonts.google.com. Se dejó la anterior."

